msgid "For values with multiple components. Best for full-text search, JSONB, and arrays—when you''re searching inside a value."
msgstr "Arvoille, joissa on useita komponentteja. Paras kokotekstihakuun, JSONB:lle ja taulukoille—kun haet arvon sisältä."

#: metabase/driver/postgres.clj
msgid "GiST"
msgstr "GiST"

#: metabase/driver/postgres.clj
msgid "For geometric, spatial, and range data. Best for \"nearest neighbor\" and overlap queries, like geographic data (PostGIS) or range types."
